{"study_accession":"PRJNA1055292","secondary_study_accession":"SRP479345","title":"Gamma/delta TCR repertoire in Common Variable Immunodeficiency","description":"The functional capacity and phenotypic characteristics of gamma/delta T cells in the context of common variable immunodeficiency (CVID) have not been explored. CVID is a primary immunodeficiency disorder characterized by impaired antibody responses, typically in the absence of T cell defects, resulting in increased susceptibility to infections. gamma/delta T cells are a subset of unconventional T cells that play crucial roles in host defense against infections. We aimed to determine the roles and functions of gamma/delta T cells in individuals with CVID.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":27,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN38988963","study_accession":"PRJNA1055292","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Group 1","description":"Group 1","sex":"not applicable","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-04-28","attributes":[["isolate","not applicable"],["age","not applicable"],["biomaterial_provider","Bryant lab, WEHI"],["collection_date","not applicable"],["geo_loc_name","Australia"],["sex","not applicable"],["tissue","PBMC"],["cell_subtype","Group 1"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR27308954","experiment_accession":"SRX22986193","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"PCR","instrument_model":"Illumina MiSeq","read_count":17472395,"base_count":5241718500,"first_public":"2024-04-28","experiment_title":"Illumina MiSeq sequencing: TCRseq of human gamma delta T cells 1"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN38988964","study_accession":"PRJNA1055292","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Group 2","description":"Group 2","sex":"not applicable","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-04-28","attributes":[["isolate","not applicable"],["age","not applicable"],["biomaterial_provider","Bryan